OL,3,ACharlotte Church accuses Ed Sheeran of
OL,4,Achoosing 'capitalism over doing the
OL,5,Aright thing'
OL,6,
OL,7,FCharlotte Church has accused Ed Sheeran
OL,8,Fof choosing "consumerism and capitalism
OL,9,Fover doing the right thing", after
OL,10,FMacklemore was dropped from his tour
OL,11,Ffor making pro-Palestinian remarks on
OL,12,Fstage.
OL,14,FSheeran said the decision to drop
OL,15,FMacklemore was made by his promoters,
OL,16,Fnot him. The row has seen ticket prices
OL,17,Fdrop and sales decline for the
OL,18,Fremaining US leg of his Loop Tour.
OL,20,FOn Saturday he apologised to fans for
OL,21,Fmaking "mistakes" as he opened his
OL,22,Ffirst show since the controversy.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
